        not: B('It does not understand the text: it compares vectors and words. A filter works only on metadata written at indexing, and HNSW is approximate.', 'No entiende el texto: compara vectores y palabras. Un filtro funciona solo con metadatos escritos al indexar, y HNSW es aproximado.'),
